IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-GLM-ATTN-MASK.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-TOTAL-TOKENS-N    PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
   05 D0-PART-A-LENGTH     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
01 D1-QUERY-COORDINATES.
   05 D1-SOURCE-TOKEN-IDX  PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
   05 D1-TARGET-TOKEN-IDX  PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
01 D2-MASK-EVALUATION.
   05 D2-IS-SRC-IN-PART-A  PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D2-IS-TGT-IN-PART-A  PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
   05 D2-ATTN-DECISION     PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R10.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 8 TO D0-TOTAL-TOKENS-N.
    MOVE 4 TO D0-PART-A-LENGTH.

    MOVE 5 TO D1-SOURCE-TOKEN-IDX.
    MOVE 2 TO D1-TARGET-TOKEN-IDX.

    PERFORM EVAL-GLM-ATTENTION-MASK.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.

    IF D2-ATTN-DECISION == 0
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 3 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

EVAL-GLM-ATTENTION-MASK.
    IF D1-SOURCE-TOKEN-IDX < D0-PART-A-LENGTH
        MOVE 1 TO D2-IS-SRC-IN-PART-A
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO D2-IS-SRC-IN-PART-A
    END-IF.

    IF D1-TARGET-TOKEN-IDX < D0-PART-A-LENGTH
        MOVE 1 TO D2-IS-TGT-IN-PART-A
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO D2-IS-TGT-IN-PART-A
    END-IF.

    IF D2-IS-SRC-IN-PART-A == 1
        IF D2-IS-TGT-IN-PART-A == 1
            MOVE 0 TO D2-ATTN-DECISION
        ELSE
            MOVE 3 TO D2-ATTN-DECISION
        END-IF
    ELSE
        IF D2-IS-TGT-IN-PART-A == 1
            MOVE 0 TO D2-ATTN-DECISION
        ELSE
            IF D1-TARGET-TOKEN-IDX <= D1-SOURCE-TOKEN-IDX
                MOVE 0 TO D2-ATTN-DECISION
            ELSE
                MOVE 3 TO D2-ATTN-DECISION
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = (D1-SOURCE-TOKEN-IDX * 32) + D1-TARGET-TOKEN-IDX.
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
